Apache Arrow / Parquet 25.0.1
-----------------------------

The native COCONut importer statically links Apache Arrow and Parquet, licensed
under Apache-2.0, with pinned bundled Snappy, Zstandard, zlib, xsimd, Apache
Thrift, and RapidJSON dependencies. Upstream licenses and notices, including
Arrow vendored notices, are retained in share/mmltk/licenses/arrow in the
packaged application. Source: https://arrow.apache.org/

